<title>UK: Samsung Electronics sets 300 million mark Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Samsung Electronics sets 300 million mark Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SAMSUNG ELECTRONICS CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    16.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.46    PAY DATE    16.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.31     SPREAD	+88 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A-	  LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BAA1	DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/KR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.65	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OBL 120 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
